---
description: Python coding conventions and the single-LLM-client rule
globs: **/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

Apply the "Coding conventions" section of `AGENTS.md` to every Python file.

Hard rule: only `src/agent/llm.py` may import `openai` or call the model API.
Everything else calls functions in `src/agent/llm.py`.
`tests/test_guardrails.py` fails if this is broken.

After editing Python, run `ruff format <file>` and `ruff check --fix <file>`
(Claude Code does this automatically with a hook; Cursor does not).
